# Claude Code: share agent definitions, keep machine-local permission grants out
.claude/settings.local.json

# Installed tooling, not this app's source. CLAUDE.md tells every agent to
# `git add -A`, which swept all three in on 2026-08-13 — ~110 vendored skill
# files plus a generated graph and its caches. Ignored so that stays a
# non-event rather than something the next session has to notice and unstage.
.claude/skills/
.impeccable/
graphify-out/

# Sprint 50 parity dump — real customer names, phones and emails pulled from
# production so the SQL aggregate can be checked against buildProfiles. Never
# commit it; delete it once the parity test has run.
scripts/sprint50/dump/

# Sprint 51 cap probe — one real customer's name, phone and email, needed so the
# receipt attaches to somebody deep in the paging order. The README says how to
# regenerate it; the file itself never gets committed.
scripts/sprint51/*.csv
